     3420         bf_tt-allsum-line.vat-rubl-buyer-doc   =  (bf_tt-allsum-line.sum-dsc-rubl-doc - bf_tt-allsum-line.slt-rubl-doc) * bf_doc-line.vat-pc / (100 + bf_doc-line.vat-pc)
